window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Expect the unexpected.</b></p> <p>In <i>Surprise</i>, Xane and her band, Sapphire Nights, embark on a major tour that tests their limits. From the excitement of their song hitting number one to the shock of a stage malfunction that could expose Xane’s true nature, this final installment explores the unexpected twists that life throws her way. Xane must navigate her Synth programming while dealing with emotional surprises, making this volume the thrilling conclusion to her emotional journey.</p> <p>Xane has faced fear, shame, sadness, love, and anger—but nothing could prepare her for the surprises that will define her final transformation.</p> <p>The Xane series takes listeners on an unforgettable journey of emotional discovery, blending sci-fi adventure with themes of self-awareness and personal growth. Each volume deepens Xane’s understanding of what it means to be human, leading to a thrilling, emotionally charged conclusion.</p> <p>Perfect for fans of Neal Shusterman’s Arc of a Scythe series, Marissa Meyer’s The Lunar Chronicles, Lauren Oliver’s Replica duology, and recent hits like K. Ancrum’s <i>The Weight of the Stars</i> and Mira Grant’s <i>A Dowry of Blood</i>, the Xane series will captivate YA sci-fi listeners who love stories about emotional intelligence, transformation, and the complexities of the human experience.</p>"; 
